{"id":"ac651a11b295edf3","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-kleene-number-realizability.md","title":"Kleene number realizability","display":"df-kleene-number-realizability — Kleene number realizability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","aliases":["72-df-kleene-number-realizability"],"display":"df-kleene-number-realizability — Kleene number realizability","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; environment form of the sentence clauses","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-kleene-number-realizability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-number-realizability — Kleene number realizability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420; environment form of the sentence clauses"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\">\\(\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k,i\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,k,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a> 中满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 的编号，沿用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 与计算图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\">\\(\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\)</span> 表示该部分函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 上有定义且值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。这是元语言中固定的计算结构，不是算术对象语言的全函数符号。</li>\n<li>固定原始递归双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(p:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span> 及其逆投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0,p_1:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(p_0,p_1:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0(p(a,b))=a\">\\(p_0(p(a,b))=a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1(p(a,b))=b\">\\(p_1(p(a,b))=b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(p_0(n),p_1(n))=n\">\\(p(p_0(n),p_1(n))=n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下按公式树递归引入元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\">\\(\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\)</span>；其签名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。对象语言联结词带下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，等价号右侧的逻辑联结词和量词属于元语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_0(n),A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),B,\\eta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_0(n),A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),B,\\eta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(p_0(n)=0\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),A,\\eta))\\lor\n(p_0(n)=1\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),B,\\eta)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(p_0(n)=0\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),A,\\eta))\\lor\n(p_0(n)=1\\land\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),B,\\eta)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NR}(m,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NR}(k,B,\\eta))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf{NR}(m,A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NR}(k,B,\\eta))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NR}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NR}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\neg_a A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\neg\\mathsf{NR}(m,A,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\neg_a A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\neg\\mathsf{NR}(m,A,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已对照原书 p.408 的七条子句，并以页图核对析取的右标签确为 1。最后的否定式由蕴涵到假公式的定义推出，和原书否定子句一致。环境形式对闭句与原书的数码代入子句完全对应：量词更新变量数值，相当于以相应数码替换自由出现。对开公式本原子定义的是给定环境下的点态实现性；原书另提到的“取全称闭包”约定不是这里省略的默认值。这里保持为外部语义，未声称已给出 HA 内部的 arithmetized rn 公式，也未将 p.410、413 的变体混同为同一实现性关系。递归仅调用严格子公式，全部输出是真值确定的关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的 $\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]$；$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$n,m,k,i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptab