sf{NR}(n,\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k\\land\\mathsf{NR}(k,A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m])),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(n),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto p_0(n)]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}(n,\\neg_a A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\neg\\mathsf{NR}(m,A,\\eta).","display":true}],"bytes":3536,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability|df-kleene-number-realizability — Kleene number realizability]]"},{"id":"e39710a1818d0447","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的 $\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a$、环境更新、固定可接受部分递归函数编号 $\\varphi_e$ 及双射 $p$ 的投影 $p_0,p_1$；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$n\\in\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$i\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-kleene-number-realizability|df-kleene-number-realizability — Kleene number realizability]]"},{"id":"703503406aed68c5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$e,a\\in\\omega$；$\\mathsf{NR}$、$\\varphi$ 和对象语言构造 $\\to_a$ 采用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的完整参数与签名。"},{"id":"db3e741fdfbf4c53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$n\\in\\omega$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$；$\\mathsf{NR}$ 与 $\\neg_a A=A\\to_a\\bot_a$ 使用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的定义及固定计算结构。"},{"id":"62e43ba0e25a67c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$n,i,m\\in\\omega$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$；$\\mathsf{NR}$ 采用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。"},{"id":"75662f8a477e661f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NR}$、可接受编号 $\\varphi_e$ 及配对 $p$ 使用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的固定结构；$\\mathsf{AT}$ 采用 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。"},{"id":"178fc8cf9cbbf910","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$e,i,j\\in\\omega$，$i\\ne j$；$\\mathsf{NR},\\varphi,p_0,p_1$ 采用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的固定结构。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-kleene-number-realizability|72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"}],"outgoing":["b0118b1d3360ec7d","bf141a6daa8808bc"]}